      "writtenOn": "2026-06-30T11:48:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes — like  roundf , FreeType rounds to the nearest in both directions:  `FT_PIX_ROUND(x) \u003d FT_PIX_FLOOR(x + 32)`  adds half a pixel before flooring, giving round‑half‑up to nearest (16.4 → 16, 16.6 → 17).",
